commit 2cfd7f064aecbff0574468221401457a01fe955b
Author: Ömer Demirel <7556489+demirelo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date:   Mon Nov 16 13:29:03 2026 +0100

    Draft 10: Fable round-5 corrections (WEIS 3/5 firm, 11 problems)
    
    P1 Run A: equivalent within the margin, direction set by one market
    (fresh5) and the search version; R3 lower on 4 of 6 markets. P2 the C*
    comparison is unresolved at p = 0.01 and 0.02 (one market sets the
    pooled sign; t intervals at 0.02 and 0.03), negative on every market at
    0.03. P4 doubled audit values beside the frozen ones (abstract, table,
    caption with the definition timing). P5 efficiency for both versions;
    B3 without a trend; fresh2 at 0.893, below the registered 0.90
    (exploratory). P6 -0.052 with the doubled -0.033. P7 conclusion names
    the one comparator. P8 replacing markets: R3 audits 0.041 to 0.095 of
    the attacker's jobs. P9 21 of 72 churn checks flagged in the abstract.
    P11 'near a third' replaced. Data: churn_block.py review_r5 block
    (per-market efficiency and audit rate; other fields byte-identical);
    churn_paper.py doubled fields, R3 at p = 0.05 per market, Run A signs,
    flag total; new number kinds. Tests first (red logs review_r5_red.log,
    summary_r5_red.log); 38, 7 and 55 pass; gate ok. Fable round-5 review
    file (final version) included.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

